# The repo-root .gitignore already covers target/, *.jar, *.class, IDE files and .DS_Store.
# Everything below is specific to imagegen.

# Generated images and their sidecars. These are outputs, often multi-megabyte,
# and land next to their inputs wherever the tool is run.
out_*

# Never commit an API key. The real config lives at ~/.config/imagegen/config.json;
# this guards against a stray copy inside the repo.
config.json

# Raw API dumps from --debug-dump-response contain base64 image payloads.
*response*.json
